FloatView is an independent, from-scratch implementation of a Windows
Picture-in-Picture utility. All source code, assets, icons, and other files
in this repository were created for this project and contain no copied
material from any other project.

Attribution note
----------------
The concept of a Windows Picture-in-Picture tool was inspired by the
open-source project "PiP-Tool" by Lionel Jouin
(https://github.com/LionelJouin/PiP-Tool, MIT License).

No source code, artwork, icons, fonts, or other assets from that project
are included in this repository. The mention above is a courtesy
acknowledgement of the original idea only.
